id=BitPerfect.module
name=BitPerfect Universal Audio Engine
version=v5.5.16-Universal
versionCode=5516
author=Kostyantyn Matviyevskyy aka kostyamat & Antigravity (c)2026
description=Bit-to-bit audio for QF001/K706: 24-bit/48 kHz path at 0 dB, volume and effects on BU32107 only. One playback output per PCM, raw unprocessed microphone for wDSP (no DP), navigation ducking, call microphone with headroom and echo cancellation on SIM (handsfree CVS), BT calls without forced communication mode, and working VoIP calls (Telegram) without the broken Unisoc VoIP record mode.
